    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "PACIFIC\nCLASS\nCarous at No Zealand",
      "Taste the flavours of\nNew Zealand right here,\ninflight with Air New Zealand.\nOur renowned dining and\nbeverage service has been\ndesigned by our team of\ncontributing chefs\nincluding Tony Adcock,\nof New Zealand's famous\nHarbourside restaurant.\nThe emphasis is on freshness\nand quality, and, as we\nhope you'll agree, a tempting\ntaste of New Zealand\nEnjoy your meal\nPlease accept our apologies\nif your first choice is not available\nY10 AUS to NZ MAR02\n207.086.006\ngarlic\nThe intense, freshness of New Zealand cuisine is given extra zip\nwith a touch of garlic. Deliciously versatile, it is used with new\nflair and confidence in the contemporary cuisine of New Zealand",
      "light option\nFruit juice\nCereal and fruit\nSpiced fruit roll\nTea and coffee\nbreaktast\nFROM AUSTRALIA\nstarter\nFruit juice\nYour choice of either the\ncontinental selection\nCereal and milk\nYoghurt\nSpiced fruit roll\nSeasonal fruit platter\nor the\nhot selection\nCereal and milk\nSpiced fruit roll\nScrambled egg,\ntomato and bacon tart\nwith pork sausage\nTea and coffee\nBREAKFAST MENU AVAILABLE\nON FLIGHTS DEPARTING\nBEFORE 9.31 AM\nlight option\nSalad of the day\nBread roll\nCheese and crackers\nIce cream\nTea and coffee\ndinner\nFROM AUSTRALIA\nsalad\nGreen bean salad with\nsour cream and almonds\nMustard potato salad\nmain course\nSmoked fish, spinach\nand potato mash pie\nOr\nPan fried pork piccata\nRoasted tomato relish to accompany\nyour meal selection\nBread roll\ndessert\nIce cream\nCheese and crackers\nTea and coffee\nDINNER MENU AVAILABLE\nON FLIGHTS DEPARTING\nFROM 3.01 PM ONWARDS"
    ],
